      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T17:07:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please add unit tests for this helper (the TestGraphicAllocation-based harness from aosp/4099133 PS4 in CCodecBuffers_test.cpp can be reused). Suggested cases:\n1. padded stride, contiguous chroma -\u003e wrap() !\u003d nullptr;\n2. padded Y slice height (e.g. 320x240, U at stride*256, V at U + (stride/2)*128) -\u003e wrapped, and image-data yields slice height 256;\n3. the Shield case (V padded beyond (stride/2)*(sliceHeight/2)) -\u003e wrap() \u003d\u003d nullptr and copyToMediaImage() produces the packed layout;\n4. uOffset % stride !\u003d 0 -\u003e copied;\n5. semi-planar with V !\u003d U + 1 -\u003e copied;\n6. a P010 variant of 1 and 3.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "c0af678c0cb0777230955a856565475226562f53",
