      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T17:07:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the planar case please also require sliceHeight % 2 \u003d\u003d 0. Clients compute the V offset two ways - (stride/2) * (sliceHeight/2) (EncodeDecodeTest, this helper) and stride * sliceHeight / 4 (VideoCodecTestBase.PackYUV420, and the converter\u0027s own copy-path layout uses stride * vStride * 5 / 4) - and those agree only for an even slice height. Cheap to guarantee here rather than rely on gralloc never producing an odd one.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "c0af678c0cb0777230955a856565475226562f53",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
